part asks_c05
  tally 2
  note "C-05 · Staś's child benefit (questions.md), as of and known as of 2026-09-30. months: for each month 2024-07 .. 2026-09, (month, Lenia's benefit due in DUK, Rosvald's due in FLR, which state pays first: true where Lenia does, T-12 .1 (a)). overpaid: what Lenia paid for months it wasn't due (FAM-2 .2), what we repaid (the joint account's six instalments) and the last instalment's day. owed on 2026-09-30: Rosvald: for each quarter, what is due less what the RFF paid by then, and the day it is due by (RFF-2 .2); Lenia: what was due to the cut less what it paid, plus what we repaid."

ask c05_months: m, lenia_due[m], rosvald_due[m], lenia_first[m] for m in month where m >= 2024-07 and m <= 2026-09 law 2026-09-30

